1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,708
The galvanised sheet barely changes.

2
00:00:02,708 --> 00:00:07,109
A little of the zinc turns white, but the iron stays bright.

3
00:00:07,109 --> 00:00:12,877
The tinned sheet rusts around the scratch, and the rust spreads faster than it would on bare iron.

4
00:00:12,877 --> 00:00:15,013
Why would a coating make things worse?

